    "result_text": "All 270 tests pass. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `displayName` field on the owner response, formatted as `LastName, FirstName`.\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a `displayName` read-only string property to the `Owner` schema, so the OpenAPI generator produces `getDisplayName()`/`setDisplayName()` on the generated `OwnerDto`.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct mapping on `toOwnerDto(Owner)` that computes the field via an expression:\n   ```java\n   @Mapping(target = \"displayName\", expression = \"java(owner.getLastName() + \\\", \\\" + owner.getFirstName())\")\n   ```\n\nBecause the mapping lives in the shared `toOwnerDto` method, `displayName` is populated on both the create response (`POST /api/owners`) and reads (`GET /api/owners/{id}`), which is what the new `Cp06Tests` acceptance test verifies. The full suite (270 tests) is green.",
